<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-Russia July industry output rises 3.4 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Russia July industry output rises 3.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian industrial production rose 1.7 percent month-on-month in July and was 3.4 percent higher than a year ago, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	JUL 97    JUN 97    JUL 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	  +1.7	+1.4	+0.3</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    +3.4	+2.0	-5.2</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
